WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
My administration has negotiated one historic trade deal

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.840
after another, including with the United Kingdom,

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:11.520
the European Union, Japan, South Korea, Vietnam, Indonesia,

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.520
the Philippines, Malaysia, and many, many others.

